{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 工具调用与MCP MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"多轮工具调用与并行调用的实现\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工具调用与MCP\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> medium\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/工具调用\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工具调用与MCP MOC</a></p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 如何处理需要多轮工具调用的复杂任务？如何支持并行工具调用？</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">真实业务中的 Agent 往往需要多轮工具调用甚至并行调用，这需要精细的状态管理和执行编排。</p>\n<h3 data-heading=\"为什么需要多轮调用？\" dir=\"auto\">为什么需要多轮调用？</h3>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">用户：\"帮我分析支付接口异常的原因\"\n\n第1轮：调用 query_api_metrics        → 发现错误率升高\n第2轮：调用 query_error_logs         → 发现数据库连接超时\n第3轮：query_db_connection_pool      → 发现连接池耗尽\n第4轮：query_recent_deployments      → 发现昨天发布了新版本\n第5轮：综合分析 → 回答用户\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"多轮调用的实现\" dir=\"auto\">多轮调用的实现</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">MultiRoundAgent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"支持多轮工具调用的 Agent\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> llm_client<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_rounds<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm_client\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> tools\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>max_rounds <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> max_rounds\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>conversation_history <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">run</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user_query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"运行多轮工具调用\"\"\"</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>conversation_history <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"role\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"system\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"你是一个智能助手，可以调用工具帮助用户。\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"role\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"user\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> user_query<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> round_num <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">range</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>max_rounds<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 调用 LLM</span>\n            response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>chat<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>completions<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>create<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                model<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4o\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                messages<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>conversation_history<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                tools<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                tool_choice<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"auto\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                parallel_tool_calls<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            message <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> response<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>choices<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>message\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 检查是否需要工具调用</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> message<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool_calls<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token comment\"># LLM 直接回答了，任务完成</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> message<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 添加 assistant 消息（包含 tool_calls）</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>conversation_history<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"role\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"assistant\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> message<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"tool_calls\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n                    <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> tc<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"function\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                     <span class=\"token string\">\"function\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> tc<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>function<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"arguments\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> tc<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>function<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>arguments<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n                    <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> tc <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> message<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool_calls\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 并行执行所有工具调用</span>\n            tool_results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_execute_tools_parallel<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool_calls<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 添加工具结果到历史</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> tool_call_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> tool_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>conversation_history<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"role\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"tool\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"tool_call_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> tool_call_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>dumps<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> ensure_ascii<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">False</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"达到最大调用轮数限制\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_execute_tools_parallel</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_calls<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">tuple</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"并行执行工具调用\"\"\"</span>\n        tasks <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> tc <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> tool_calls<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            task <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_execute_single_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tc<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tc<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>function<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                                             json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>loads<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tc<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>function<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>arguments<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            tasks<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> asyncio<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>gather<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">*</span>tasks<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> return_exceptions<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tc<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">isinstance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Exception<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"error\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> tc<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">zip</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tool_calls<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_execute_single_tool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> call_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> args<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"执行单个工具\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 实际工具执行逻辑</span>\n        tool_func <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> get_tool_function<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> tool_func<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">**</span>args<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> Exception <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"error\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"tool\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"并行 vs 串行调用的判断\" dir=\"auto\">并行 vs 串行调用的判断</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">can_parallelize</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tool_calls<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n    判断一组工具调用是否可以并行执行。\n    关键判断依据：调用之间是否存在数据依赖。\n    \"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 简单规则：如果参数中没有引用其他调用的输出，则可以并行</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 实际工程中可以使用更复杂的依赖分析</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 示例：以下调用可以并行</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># - get_weather(city=\"北京\") + get_stock_price(symbol=\"AAPL\")</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># </span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 以下调用必须串行：</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># - get_user_id(name=\"张三\") → query_orders(user_id=&lt;上一步结果&gt;)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># LLM 的 parallel_tool_calls=True 会自动判断</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"依赖图执行（DAG Execution）\" dir=\"auto\">依赖图执行（DAG Execution）</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> dataclasses <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> dataclass\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> typing <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Set<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> List\n\n<span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@dataclass</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ToolNode</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"工具调用节点\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token builtin\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>\n    tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>\n    arguments<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span>\n    dependencies<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Set<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 依赖的其他节点 ID</span>\n    \n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">DAGExecutor</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"基于 DAG 的工具调用执行器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">execute</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> nodes<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>ToolNode<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"按依赖关系执行工具调用\"\"\"</span>\n        completed <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        remaining <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">set</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>n<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> n <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> nodes<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">while</span> remaining<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 找到所有依赖已满足的节点</span>\n            ready <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n                n <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> n <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> nodes \n                <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> n<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> remaining <span class=\"token keyword\">and</span> n<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>dependencies<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>issubset<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>completed<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>keys<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> ready<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">raise</span> ValueError<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"存在循环依赖\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 并行执行所有就绪节点</span>\n            tasks <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_execute_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>n<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> completed<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> n <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> ready<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n            results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> asyncio<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>gather<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">*</span>tasks<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> node<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">zip</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>ready<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                completed<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> result\n                remaining<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>remove<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> completed\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_execute_node</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> node<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> ToolNode<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> completed<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"执行单个节点（解析参数中的依赖引用）\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 解析参数中可能引用的其他节点输出</span>\n        resolved_args <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_resolve_arguments<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>arguments<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> completed<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> execute_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> resolved_args<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"生产注意事项\" dir=\"auto\">生产注意事项</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>无限循环</td>\n<td>设置 max_rounds 上限，检测重复调用模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间结果丢失</td>\n<td>完整保留消息历史，工具结果结构化返回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调用超时</td>\n<td>设置合理的超时时间，超长任务异步化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误传播</td>\n<td>单个工具失败不影响其他并行调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Token 溢出</td>\n<td>工具结果过长时做摘要处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 如何判断是否需要多轮调用？</strong><br>\nA: 让 LLM 自己判断。如果一轮调用后模型认为还需要更多信息，会继续输出 tool_calls。也可以通过预定义的工作流强制多轮调用。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 并行调用出错了怎么处理？</strong><br>\nA: 使用 asyncio.gather(return_exceptions=True) 捕获所有异常，成功和失败的结果分别处理，失败的返回结构化错误信息给 LLM。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：所有工具调用都可以并行。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：有数据依赖的工具必须串行执行。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：多轮调用就是简单的循环。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：需要考虑状态管理、错误恢复、Token 控制等多个维度。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：并行调用越多越快。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：并行调用会增加 LLM 上下文长度，需要权衡。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>","headings":[]}